  "description": "With the T.E.M.P.O. POWER SIGNATURE AXS, you’ll forget you’re riding an e-bike. Whether climbing or descending, that true ride feeling is at the forefront.\n• The FOX 36 Factory fork features Kashima coated stanchions and a Grip X2 cartridge which is widely adjustable. The FOX Float Factory shock is tuned to the frame kinematics for ideal progression, support, and responsiveness.\n• SHIMANO Deore XT 4-piston brakes with 203mm MT905 rotors and Ice Tech Freeza pads provide a reliable and crisp feel.\n• The DT SWISS HX 1700 LS wheels are reliable and durable.\n• A SRAM XO Eagle drivetrain with wireless derailleur delivers ultimately precise shifting. Its modular construction makes exposed or worn parts replaceable.",
